{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"common denominator common denominator","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","fileName":"Common Denominator.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Common Denominator","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Fractions and Decimal Forms]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Fractions and Decimal Forms","Denominator","Least Common Denominator","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"common denominator common denominator","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","fileName":"Common Denominator.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Common Denominator","heading":"Common Denominator","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A common denominator is a shared [[Denominator]] used to express two or more fractions in comparable units. Fractions with denominators (b) and (d) can always be rewritten over (bd):\n\n$$\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{ad}{bd},\\qquad \\frac{c}{d}=\\frac{bc}{bd}.$$\n\nOnce the units match, numerators can be added or subtracted. The chosen denominator need not be the smallest possible one; any common multiple works and can be reduced afterward. The smallest choice is the [[Least Common Denominator]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Fractions and Decimal Forms","Denominator","Least Common Denominator","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"common denominator common denominator","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Common Denominator.md","fileName":"Common Denominator.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Common Denominator","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Fractions and Decimal Forms","Denominator","Least Common Denominator","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}